# Not maintained anymore.
# sid2pcm runs in an endless loop. For example, if you encode an mp3 file with
# $ sid2pcm [sidfile] | lame -r -s 44100 -a - output.mp3
# You must randomly stop sid2pcm by typing CTRL-C.
media-sound/sid2pcm

